WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.501
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.968
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.300
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.100
The White House today
announced new initiatives

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.601
to combat junk fees.

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.767
Sounds like somebody
tried to see Frankie Valli.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:15.000
"Convenience fee?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.067
Jill, get Janet Yellen
on the phone."

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.968
House Republicans
today nominated Majority

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:22.100
Leader Steve Scalise
to be the next speaker,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.968
while next week's Speaker
is still anyone's guess.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:26.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.400
Federal prosecutors accused

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.133
Republican Congressman
Jorge Santos

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:33.300
yesterday of stealing campaign
donors' identities.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.434
But if you donated money
to Jorge Santos,

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:38.100
you're probably looking for
a new identity anyway.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.601
That's right.
Federal prosecutors

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.234
filed 23 charges
against Republican Congressman

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:46.601
Jorge Santos,
including two counts

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:50.234
of aggravated identity theft,
two counts of wire fraud

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:53.801
and numerous counts of trying
to make this look a thing.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:57.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.701
A group of House Republicans
who call themselves

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:03.667
Okay for Only Kevin are
reportedly planning to nominate

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.801
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
for the speakership.

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:08.133
Unfortunately, a group
that calls themselves

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.868
F-K won't let them.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.734
At a campaign rally earlier
this week, former president

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.901
Trump said that he believes
former president Barack Obama

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:19.734
is in control
of the White House.

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:23.300
Yeah, right. You wish.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.501
And also we wish.

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:30.000
In a new interview...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.300
...Vice President Kamala Harris
said that she loves her job,

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:34.667
though it was a little
concerning

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:37.100
that she said it in response
to every single question.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.601
According to a new report,
the super PAC affiliated

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:44.567
with Robert F. Kennedy Jr.
raised $11 million

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:46.534
in the 24 hours
after he announced

00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:48.801
he was running for president
as an independent.

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:51.834
Wow. Kennedy hasn't made
millions of dollars that fast

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:53.434
since the day he was born.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:57.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.901
When asked to identify him
yesterday in court,

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:02.501
disgraced FTX CEO
Sam Bankman-Fried's

00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:04.934
ex-girlfriend reportedly
took nearly 30 seconds

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:08.501
to recognize him because he
finally tried conditioner.

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.300
A library in Scotland
recently received a book

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.100
that was nearly
50 years overdue.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.701
The person would
have returned it sooner,

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:22.634
but they were waiting
for a sunny day.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:26.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:29.534
Yeah, we'll [bleep] burn
Scottish weather.

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:33.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.667
If not this week, when?

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:36.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:39.267
According to a new report,
Apple CEO Tim Cook

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:41.501
starts his day by reading
hundreds of customer

00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:43.834
feedback e-mails
before going to the gym.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:46.334
Oh, wow. Sounds like Tim Cook
and I have something in common.

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:47.801
We both like to lie.

00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:51.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.801
And finally, a cruise ship
in the Pacific Ocean

00:02:53.801 --> 00:02:55.534
recently rescued a naked man

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:57.567
who was clinging
to a capsized boat.

00:02:57.567 --> 00:02:59.267
The man was able
to get a hot meal,

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.300
some clean clothes and COVID.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.467
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:05.467
We're off and running.

